# Style and patterns

- Prettier + `prettier-plugin-tailwindcss`. Double quotes, semicolons. `.ts`/`.tsx` only.
- Imports via `@/`. Pages default-export. Helpers/types named-export.
- Server Components by default. `"use client"` only for state, effects, or events.
- New server data: `createServerClient` from `@supabase/ssr` + `cookies()`. Client: `@/lib/supabase`.
- Types: `Database` from `@/lib/database.types`, domain from `@/lib/app.types`. Do not hand-edit generated types — `pnpm gen:types`.
- Server Actions in colocated `actions.ts`. After writes, `revalidatePath` admin + public pages.
- Classes via `cn()`. Brand: black + `yellow-400`, `font-lexend` / `font-questrial`. Reuse `btnSaveYlw`, `btnCancel`, `adminHeader`.
- Components `PascalCase.tsx`. Actions `camelCase` verbs. DB columns stay `snake_case`. Keep table names `categories` / `services`.
- Auth only in `proxy.ts`. Do not re-check in `admin/layout.tsx`.
